  "keywords": ["EFC", "growth rate", "RSD", "fsigma8", "regime-dependent gravity", "mu(a)", "perturbation sector"],
  "abstract": "First multi-epoch test of EFC perturbation-sector coupling using 14 fσ8(z) measurements over z=0.067–1.491. EFC with regime-dependent μ(a)=1−B·T(a) yields χ²=11.98/11 vs ΛCDM χ²=12.07/12 (Δχ²=0.10, 0.06σ). Null result; ΛCDM marginally preferred (ΔAIC=−1.9). B=0 within 1σ profile; survival valley μ0∈[0.93,0.96] consistent with data. Strong Ωm–B degeneracy requires joint BAO+fσ8 fit to break."
}
